      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is a 21-year-old caucasian girl. Their name is Daniela.\n<Picture 1> is the exact last frame of [Shot 1], showing <Subject 1> Daniela mid truck in, eating the ice cream at the lakeside campsite.\n<Video 1> is <Subject 1>\n\nsummary:\n[continuation] No cut: the truck in continues without interruption until it stops on a close up of <Subject 1> Daniela enjoying the ice cream.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Picture 1>: fully_preserved - [Shot 2] starts from this exact frame and every element of it stays in place while the camera moves closer.\n<Subject 1>: fully_preserved - the same person continues from the previous segment.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is a live-action, candid video, made outdoors on a professional camera.\n[Shot 2] The same uninterrupted shot continues from <Picture 1> with no cut: the camera keeps the truck in that was already in motion at the end of [Shot 1] and pushes in gradually until it comes to rest on a close up of <Subject 1> Daniela taking another bite of the ice cream and smiling. The lakeside campsite, the people in the background, the daylight, her bikini top and shorts all remain exactly as in <Picture 1> for the whole shot - the only change is the camera moving closer. There is no cut, no new scene and no framing jump.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nOutdoor ambience fitting the scene, continuing from the previous shot.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
        "{\"version\":1,\"mode\":\"REF\",\"off\":{},\"duration\":5,\"p2Shot\":1,\"lastShot\":1,\"imd\":\"\",\"soundscape\":\"\",\"music\":\"N/A\",\"ref\":{\"subjectDefs\":[{\"text\":\"<Subject 1> is a 21-year-old caucasian girl.\",\"name\":\"Daniela\",\"role\":null},{\"text\":\"<Picture 1> is the exact last frame of [Shot 1], showing <Subject 1> Daniela mid truck in, eating the ice cream at the lakeside campsite.\",\"role\":null},{\"text\":\"<Video 1> is <Subject 1>\",\"role\":null}],\"summaryTypes\":[\"reference generation\"],\"summaryText\":\"!No cut: the truck in continues until it stops on a close up of Daniela enjoying the ice cream.\",\"retention\":[{\"label\":\"<Picture 1>\",\"context\":\"\",\"marker\":\"fully_preserved\",\"note\":\"[Shot 2] starts from this exact frame and every element of it stays in place while the camera moves closer.\"},{\"label\":\"<Subject 1>\",\"context\":\"\",\"marker\":\"fully_preserved\",\"note\":\"\"}],\"styleLine\":\"The target video is a live-action, candid video, made outdoors on a professional camera.\",\"detail\":\"[Shot 2] The same uninterrupted shot continues from <Picture 1> with no cut: the camera keeps the truck in that was already in motion at the end of [Shot 1] and pushes in gradually until it comes to rest on a close up of !Daniela taking another bite of the ice cream and smiling.\",\"soundscape\":\"Outdoor ambience fitting the scene, continuing from the previous shot.\",\"music\":\"N/A\"}}"
